<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#141519;">Your account is temporarily locked</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Someone tried to sign in to your {{ brand }} account with the wrong password several times, so we locked it to protect you. You can sign in again after {{ locked_until }}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If this was you, wait until then and try again, or reset your password now.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#c3e84f;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="{{ reset_link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#141519;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Reset my password</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#4b4e4a;font-size:14px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<a href="{{ reset_link }}" style="color:#141519;word-break:break-all;">{{ reset_link }}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If this was not you, those attempts did not get into your account, but someone may be guessing your password. We recommend choosing a new, strong one.</p>
